## 📏 SPACING SYSTEM

### Standard Spacing Scale (use multiples of 4)

```javascript
SPACING = {
  xs: 4, // Tiny gaps
  sm: 8, // Small gaps
  md: 12, // Medium gaps
  lg: 16, // Large gaps - DEFAULT for most padding
  xl: 20, // Extra large
  xxl: 24, // Section spacing
  xxxl: 32, // Major sections
};

// RULE: Always use these values, never random numbers like 15 or 18
```

### Component-Specific Spacing

```javascript
// Cards
CARD_PADDING: 16,              // Inside padding for most cards
CARD_PADDING_LARGE: 20,        // Larger cards (wallet, important sections)
CARD_PADDING_XL: 24,           // Hero cards, modals
CARD_MARGIN_BOTTOM: 16,        // Space between cards

// Sections
SECTION_SPACING: 24,           // Space between major sections
SECTION_HEADER_MARGIN: 16,     // Space below section headers

// Container
CONTAINER_PADDING_H: 16,       // Horizontal padding for main container
CONTAINER_PADDING_V: 20,       // Vertical padding for main container
```

