## ✅ DESIGN RULES CHECKLIST

When redesigning any screen, ensure you follow these rules:

### Colors

- [ ] Main background is #F9FAFB
- [ ] All cards are white (#FFFFFF)
- [ ] Primary action color is #10B981
- [ ] Text uses hierarchy (#111827, #374151, #6B7280)
- [ ] No borders on cards (use shadows instead)
- [ ] Service icons use pastel backgrounds (15% opacity)

### Spacing

- [ ] Container padding: 16px horizontal, 20px vertical
- [ ] Card padding: 16-24px
- [ ] Section spacing: 20-24px
- [ ] Icon containers: 56x56px (standard)
- [ ] All spacing uses multiples of 4

### Typography

- [ ] All headings have letterSpacing: 0.3-0.5
- [ ] Font weights are numeric (700, 600, 500)
- [ ] Buttons use 700 weight
- [ ] Body text uses 500-600 weight
- [ ] Labels use 500 weight

### Borders & Shadows

- [ ] Border radius: 16px (default), 20-24px (hero)
- [ ] Cards have subtle shadows (not borders)
- [ ] Important elements have colored shadows
- [ ] Shadow offset: { width: 0, height: 2-8 }

### Components

- [ ] Section headers have icons
- [ ] Buttons have proper padding (12-16px vertical)
- [ ] Badges have 12px border radius
- [ ] Modals are bottom sheets
- [ ] ScrollView hides indicators

### Icons

- [ ] Section icons: 20px, #10B981
- [ ] Service icons: 24-28px, colored
- [ ] Icon containers: 56x56px with 16px radius
- [ ] Backgrounds use 15% opacity of icon color

